      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "## Nexus-7 LiDAR Module Quick-Start Guide\n\n### 1. Safety Protocols and Operational Warnings\n*   **Lens Safety Mandate:** Under no circumstances should personnel look directly into the LiDAR lens during active module operation.\n*   **Environmental Checks:** Verify that the installation site adheres to all specified operational environmental parameters.\n\n### 2. Physical Hardware Integration\n*   **Power Input Specification:** Confirm the power supply voltage is strictly within the 12V-24V DC range.\n*   **Connector Attachment:** Securely attach the module using the designated 4-pin aviation connector.\n*   **Mounting Procedure Details:** Affix the unit firmly to the target surface utilizing the pre-drilled M3 screw holes.\n\n### 3. System Initialization Sequence\n*   **Power Application:** Apply the regulated DC power source to the module terminals.\n*   **Status LED Confirmation:** Monitor the indicator light until the solid green LED confirms readiness.\n*   **Terminal Command Execution:** Access the system terminal and execute the required `nexus_init` command.",
